m_college_coding = make_mission("m_college_coding", "college", 2, ["f1_ai_capabilities","f3_checking_evidence"],
    "Debug with AI (Verify First)", "Ask AI for coding help and critically evaluate the explanation.", "You can get coding help from AI while verifying the explanation is correct.",
    "AI can spot bugs quickly, but its explanations may be wrong. Always verify: Does the fix actually address the bug? Is the explanation accurate?",
    {"scenario": "Binary search function has an off-by-one error.", "bad_attempt": "Fix this code.", "good_attempt": "Goal: Identify the bug in this binary search function and explain why it fails.\nContext: Python function, expected to return index of target in sorted list.\nConstraints: Explain the specific error (not just 'it's wrong'). Show what happens with input [1,3,5,7,9] searching for 5.\nOutput: Bug explanation + corrected code + trace through example.", "why_better": "Asks for explanation and verification, not just a fix."},
    {"instruction": "This Python binary search has a bug. Write an AI instruction to get help debugging it, then identify which parts of AI's response to verify:\n\n```python\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr)\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return -1\n```", "starter_text": "AI instruction to get help:\n\nWhat I would verify in AI's response:\n1. \n2. \n3. ", "hints": ["What happens when left = mid? Could this cause an infinite loop?", "Test with a specific input: binary_search([1,3,5,7], 7)", "Verify: does AI's explanation match what actually happens?"], "sample_good_response": "AI instruction: Identify the bug in this binary search function. Trace through the execution with input [1,3,5,7] searching for 7. Show step-by-step what left, right, and mid values are at each iteration. Explain why it fails.\n\nWhat I would verify:\n1. Does the identified bug match what I see when I trace through manually?\n2. Does the corrected code handle edge cases (empty array, target not found, single element)?\n3. Is the explanation of why left = mid causes an infinite loop actually correct?", "evaluation_criteria": ["Asks for step-by-step explanation, not just fix", "Identifies what to verify in AI response", "Considers edge cases"], "produces_artifact": False},
    [{"question": "Why should you verify AI's code explanation, not just the fix?", "options": ["The fix might work but the explanation could be wrong, leading to future misunderstanding", "AI explanations are always correct", "Verification wastes time", "Code that works is always correct"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "AI might give a fix that works but explain why incorrectly. Understanding the real reason helps you learn."}, {"question": "What's the best way to verify a code fix?", "options": ["Trace through the execution with specific inputs yourself", "Trust the AI if the code runs", "Ask AI if its own answer is correct", "Only check if it compiles"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Manually tracing through with specific inputs lets you verify both the fix and the explanation."}],
    {"pass": "Great approach! You're asking for explanations and verifying them.", "partial": "Good start. Add more about what specifically to verify in AI's response.", "fail": "Try again. Don't just ask for a fix — ask for an explanation you can verify."},
    "You practiced getting coding help from AI responsibly. Always ask for explanations and verify them with specific test cases.",
    [{"term": "off-by-one error", "definition": "A bug where a loop or index is one step too many or too few."}, {"term": "trace", "definition": "Following code execution step by step to understand what happens."}],
    "AI से डिबग करें (पहले जाँचें)", "AI से कोडिंग मदद लें और स्पष्टीकरण सत्यापित करें।",
    "AI తో డీబగ్ చేయండి (మొదట ధృవీకరించండి)", "AI నుండి కోడింగ్ సహాయం పొంది వివరణ ధృవీకరించండి.",
    "AI-யுடன் பிழைநீக்கம் (முதலில் சரிபார்க்கவும்)", "AI-லிருந்து குறியீட்டு உதவி பெற்று விளக்கத்தை சரிபார்க்கவும்.",
    "AI ಜೊತೆ ಡೀಬಗ್ ಮಾಡಿ (ಮೊದಲು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ)", "AI ಯಿಂದ ಕೋಡಿಂಗ್ ಸಹಾಯ ಪಡೆದು ವಿವರಣೆ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ."
)

