    "Here's a secret: getting the answer isn't the goal — understanding HOW to solve it is! 🎯\n\nAI can be like a helpful tutor who gives you hints instead of answers. Let's practice with a fun word problem about planning a school event.",
    {"scenario": "Planning a school science fair budget.", "bad_attempt": "What's 47 × 3 + 125 × 2?", "good_attempt": "Goal: Help me solve this word problem step by step with HINTS, not the answer.\nContext: I'm planning a school science fair. I need to buy supplies.\nConstraints: Give me one hint at a time. Wait for me to try before giving the next hint. Start by helping me identify what information I need.\nOutput: First hint only.", "why_better": "Asks for hints instead of answers, so the student actually learns the method."},
    {"instruction": "Solve this problem using AI for HINTS (not answers!):\n\n🧩 Problem: Your school is organizing a science fair. You need:\n• 3 display boards at ₹150 each\n• 2 packs of markers at ₹85 each\n• 5 sheets of chart paper at ₹25 each\n• 1 pack of stickers at ₹60\n\nYour teacher gave you ₹800. Do you have enough money? If not, how much more do you need?\n\nInstead of asking AI for the answer, write an AI instruction that gives you HINTS to solve it yourself!", "starter_text": "My AI instruction for hints:\n\nMy work:\nStep 1: \nStep 2: \nStep 3: \nAnswer: ", "hints": ["First hint: List all the items and their costs. Can you find the cost of each type of item?", "Second hint: For items with multiple quantities, multiply: quantity × price. Try the display boards first: 3 × ₹150 = ?", "Third hint: Add up all the costs. Then compare with ₹800.", "Final hint: If total > ₹800, subtract ₹800 from total to find how much more you need."], "sample_good_response": "My AI instruction: I'm solving a word problem about a school science fair budget. Don't tell me the answer! Give me hints one at a time. Start by asking me what information I can find in the problem.\n\nMy work:\nStep 1: List items - 3 boards (₹150), 2 markers (₹85), 5 chart paper (₹25), 1 stickers (₹60)\nStep 2: Calculate each - Boards: 3×150=₹450, Markers: 2×85=₹170, Paper: 5×25=₹125, Stickers: ₹60\nStep 3: Total = 450+170+125+60 = ₹805\nAnswer: Total is ₹805, budget is ₹800. I need ₹5 more!", "evaluation_criteria": ["Asks for hints instead of direct answers", "Shows step-by-step work", "Arrives at a reasonable answer"], "produces_artifact": False},
    [{"question": "Why is it better to ask AI for hints instead of answers?", "options": ["You learn the method and can solve similar problems on your own", "AI can't give correct answers", "Hints are faster", "Answers are always wrong"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "When you work through problems with hints, you learn the method. Next time you face a similar problem, you can solve it yourself!"}, {"question": "What should you do after solving a problem with AI hints?", "options": ["Check your answer by trying a different method or re-reading the problem", "Move on immediately", "Ask AI to confirm your answer", "Erase your work"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Double-checking builds confidence and catches mistakes. Try re-reading the problem or using a different calculation method."}],
    {"pass": "🎉 Fantastic work! You solved it step by step!", "partial": "Good effort! 💪 Show more of your work for each step.", "fail": "Let's try again! 🔄 Start by listing all the items and their prices."},
